<lang name="English" official="false">
	<string name="mission.hwp_forsaken_tower.name">The Forsaken Tower</string>
	<string name="mission.hwp_forsaken_tower.desc">Climb the tower of the first game: the Mines, the Prison, the Armory, the Archives, the Chambers and the Battlements. Eighteen floors, six bosses, no way back.</string>
	<string name="hwp.campaign.portal">Forsaken Tower portal</string>
	<string name="hwp.campaign.status">Forsaken Tower: %state%. Mission %found% (%floors% floors, diff %span%)%flag%. Portal at %x%,%y%.</string>
	<string name="hwp.campaign.portal_locked">The portal is dormant. Finish the story intro to open the Forsaken Tower.</string>
	<string name="hwp.campaign.locked">, locked until the story intro is done</string>
	<string name="hwp.campaign.missing">Forsaken Tower: mission not registered - check the log.</string>
	<string name="mission.hwp_forsaken_tower_hoh1.name">The Forsaken Tower (HoH1 levels)</string>
	<string name="mission.hwp_forsaken_tower_hoh1.desc">The tower of the first game as it was: its own generated floors, enemies and traps in the Mines, the Prison, the Armory, the Archives and the Chambers, the Stone Guardian, the Warden, the Three Councilors, the Watcher, the Vampire Lord, both Battlements, the bridge and Thundersnow at the top. Twenty-three floors. Needs tools/import_hoh1.py campaign.</string>
